{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"complex-lesson02","version":1,"title":"工業数学Ａ１","subtitle":"第2回 · 第2章の残りと複素積分","scope":"a1.pdfの第2章の命題2.3後から章末まで、物理ページ7〜8。第4章の最初から命題4.1まで、物理ページ11〜12。第3章と命題4.1後の例は含めない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期木２]工業数学Ａ１/授業資料/a1.pdf","sha256":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af","pageCount":85,"reviewedPages":[7,8,11,12],"method":"原資料の該当ページ画像を目視し、問題・解答・適用条件を照らし合わせた。添付画像は画像1枚を1ページとして参照する。"}],"questions":[{"id":"complex-l02-q01","version":1,"prompt":"\\(f(x+iy)=u(x,y)+iv(x,y)\\)のコーシー・リーマンの関係式は？","answer":"\\(u_x=v_y\\)、\\(u_y=-v_x\\)。","criterion":"2つの関係と負号を正しく言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":7,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:7"},{"file":"a1.pdf","page":8,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:8"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x+iy)=u(x,y)+iv(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span>のコーシー・リーマンの関係式は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=v_y</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y=-v_x</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"2つの関係と負号を正しく言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"complex-l02-q02","version":1,"prompt":"u,vが領域でC¹級で、\\(f=u+iv\\)とする。fの正則性を判定するには、どんな関係式を確かめればよい？","answer":"領域のすべての点で\\(u_x=v_y\\)、\\(u_y=-v_x\\)を確かめる。","criterion":"C¹級の仮定の下で、領域全体のコーシー・リーマンの関係式を確かめると言えれば正解。","explanation":"1点で関係式が成り立つだけでは、その近傍での正則性を示したことにならない。","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":7,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:7"},{"file":"a1.pdf","page":8,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:8"}],"promptHtml":"u,vが領域でC¹級で、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=u+iv</annotation></semantics></math></span>とする。fの正則性を判定するには、どんな関係式を確かめればよい？","answerHtml":"領域のすべての点で<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=v_y</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y=-v_x</annotation></semantics></math></span>を確かめる。","criterionHtml":"C¹級の仮定の下で、領域全体のコーシー・リーマンの関係式を確かめると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":"1点で関係式が成り立つだけでは、その近傍での正則性を示したことにならない。"},{"id":"complex-l02-q03","version":1,"prompt":"C¹級の複素関数fの正則性は、\\(\\partial/\\partial\\bar z=\\tfrac12(\\partial/\\partial x+i\\partial/\\partial y)\\)を使うと、どんな等式で表せる？","answer":"\\(\\partial f/\\partial\\bar z=0\\)。","criterion":"共役変数側の微分が0と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":8,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:8"}],"promptHtml":"C¹級の複素関数fの正則性は、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial/\\partial\\bar z=\\tfrac12(\\partial/\\partial x+i\\partial/\\partial y)</annotation></semantics></math></span>を使うと、どんな等式で表せる？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial f/\\partial\\bar z=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"共役変数側の微分が0と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"complex-l02-q04","version":1,"prompt":"向きのある区分的C¹級曲線Cを\\(z=z(t),a\\le t\\le b\\)と表す。連続な複素関数fの複素積分\\(\\int_C f(z)\\,dz\\)を、実変数tの積分に直す式は？","answer":"\\(\\int_C f(z)\\,dz=\\int_a^b f(z(t))z^{\\prime}(t)\\,dt\\)。","criterion":"fへの代入だけでなく、z′を掛けると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:11"}],"promptHtml":"向きのある区分的C¹級曲線Cを<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=z(t),a\\le t\\le b</annotation></semantics></math></span>と表す。連続な複素関数fの複素積分<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_C f(z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span>を、実変数tの積分に直す式は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_C f(z)\\,dz=\\int_a^b f(z(t))z^{\\prime}(t)\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"fへの代入だけでなく、z′を掛けると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"complex-l02-q05","version":1,"prompt":"連続な複素関数の経路積分を指定するとき、始点と終点だけで積分値は必ず決まる？","answer":"決まらない。一般には経路とその向きも指定する。","criterion":"経路と向きが必要と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:11"}],"promptHtml":"連続な複素関数の経路積分を指定するとき、始点と終点だけで積分値は必ず決まる？","answerHtml":"決まらない。一般には経路とその向きも指定する。","criterionHtml":"経路と向きが必要と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"complex-l02-q06","version":1,"prompt":"C⁻¹を向きのある曲線Cの逆向きの曲線とする。\\(\\int_{C^{-1}}f(z)\\,dz\\)と\\(\\int_Cf(z)\\,dz\\)の関係は？","answer":"\\(\\int_{C^{-1}}f(z)\\,dz=-\\int_Cf(z)\\,dz\\)。","criterion":"符号が反転すると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":12,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:12"}],"promptHtml":"C⁻¹を向きのある曲線Cの逆向きの曲線とする。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{C^{-1}}f(z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span>と<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Cf(z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span>の関係は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{C^{-1}}f(z)\\,dz=-\\int_Cf(z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"符号が反転すると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"complex-l02-q07","version":1,"prompt":"C₁の終点がC₂の始点に一致し、C₁からC₂へ順にたどる曲線をC₁C₂とする。連続関数の積分はどう分けられる？","answer":"\\(\\int_{C_1C_2}f(z)\\,dz=\\int_{C_1}f(z)\\,dz+\\int_{C_2}f(z)\\,dz\\)。","criterion":"各経路での積分の和と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":12,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:12"}],"promptHtml":"C₁の終点がC₂の始点に一致し、C₁からC₂へ順にたどる曲線をC₁C₂とする。連続関数の積分はどう分けられる？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{C_1C_2}f(z)\\,dz=\\int_{C_1}f(z)\\,dz+\\int_{C_2}f(z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"各経路での積分の和と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"complex-l02-q08","version":1,"prompt":"区分的C¹級曲線C上で\\(|f(z)|\\le M\\)、Cの長さをℓとする。\\(\\left|\\int_C f(z)\\,dz\\right|\\)の上界は？","answer":"\\(M\\ell\\)。","criterion":"関数の絶対値の上界×曲線の長さと言えれば正解。","explanation":"命題4.1の積分の絶対値評価と曲線長の式から得る。","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":12,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:12"}],"promptHtml":"区分的C¹級曲線C上で<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|f(z)|\\le M</annotation></semantics></math></span>、Cの長さをℓとする。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left|\\int_C f(z)\\,dz\\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span>の上界は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"関数の絶対値の上界×曲線の長さと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":"命題4.1の積分の絶対値評価と曲線長の式から得る。"},{"id":"complex-l02-q09","version":1,"prompt":"同じ向きの曲線を、区分的C¹級の単調な再パラメータ化で表し直すと、連続関数の複素積分の値は変わる？","answer":"変わらない。","criterion":"向きを保つパラメータの取り替えで積分値は不変と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"a1.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:11"}],"promptHtml":"同じ向きの曲線を、区分的C¹級の単調な再パラメータ化で表し直すと、連続関数の複素積分の値は変わる？","answerHtml":"変わらない。","criterionHtml":"向きを保つパラメータの取り替えで積分値は不変と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:7":"./assets/sources/0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af-7.png","0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:8":"./assets/sources/0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af-8.png","0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:11":"./assets/sources/0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af-11.png","0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af:12":"./assets/sources/0cd174f170304b00aa4435c4edfe5352763d7a4f8b40ae14e2908abc496ca3af-12.png"},"renderVersion":1}